imize formulations for both">Understanding these differences enables manufacturers to optimize formulations for both</span> <strong data-start="6432" data-end="6482"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_205" data-source="" data-orig="functional performance and end‑product quality">functional performance and end‑product quality</span></strong>.</p><hr data-start="6485" data-end="6488" /><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Frequently_Asked_Questions"></span><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_206" data-source="" data-orig="Frequently Asked Questions">Frequently Asked Questions</span></strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><div class="faq-item"><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="What_is_the_difference_between_potato_flakes_and_granules"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_207" data-source="" data-orig="What is the difference between potato flakes and granules">What is the difference between potato flakes and granules</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_208" data-source="" data-orig="Potato flakes are sheet-like and partially gelatinized">Potato flakes are sheet-like and partially gelatinized</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_209" data-source="" data-orig="ideal as ingredient for snacks and composite products">ideal as ingredient for snacks and composite products</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_210" data-source="" data-orig="Granules are fully gelatinized">Granules are fully gelatinized</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_211" data-source="" data-orig="smaller">smaller</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_212" data-source="" data-orig="and smoother">and smoother</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_213" data-source="" data-orig="suitable for instant mashed potato products">suitable for instant mashed potato products</span>.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Which_product_is_better_for_mashed_potato_dishes"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_214" data-source="" data-orig="Which product is better for mashed potato dishes">Which product is better for mashed potato dishes</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_215" data-source="" data-orig="Potato granules are preferred for mashed potato dishes because they are fully cooked and produce a creamier texture when rehydrated">Potato granules are preferred for mashed potato dishes because they are fully cooked and produce a creamier texture when rehydrated</span>.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Can_potato_flakes_be_used_directly_for_consumption"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_216" data-source="" data-orig="Can potato flakes be used directly for consumption">Can potato flakes be used directly for consumption</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_217" data-source="" data-orig="Potato flakes are generally not fully cooked and are designed to be used as ingredients in further processing">Potato flakes are generally not fully cooked and are designed to be used as ingredients in further processing</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_218" data-source="" data-orig="rather than for direct consumption">rather than for direct consumption</span>.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="How_are_potato_flakes_and_granules_processed_differently"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_219" data-source="" data-orig="How are potato flakes and granules processed differently">How are potato flakes and granules processed differently</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_220" data-source="" data-orig="Both products share similar processing steps">Both products share similar processing steps</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_221" data-source="" data-orig="but flakes are drum-dried to produce sheet-like flakes">but flakes are drum-dried to produce sheet-like flakes</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_222" data-source="" data-orig="whereas granules are dried/agglomerated to produce small">whereas granules are dried/agglomerated to produce small</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_223" data-source="" data-orig="uniform particles">uniform particles</span>.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="What_are_the_main_applications_of_potato_flakes"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_224" data-source="" data-orig="What are the main applications of potato flakes">What are the main applications of potato flakes</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_225" data-source="" data-orig="Potato flakes are used in snacks">Potato flakes are used in snacks</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_226" data-source="" data-orig="bakery products">bakery products</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_227" data-source="" data-orig="composite mixes">composite mixes</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_228" data-source="" data-orig="and as functional ingredients for water binding and texture modification">and as functional ingredients for water binding and texture modification</span>.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="What_are_the_main_applications_of_potato_granules"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_229" data-source="" data-orig="What are the main applications of potato granules">What are the main applications of potato granules</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_230" data-source="" data-orig="Potato granules are used in instant mashed potatoes">Potato granules are used in instant mashed potatoes</span>, 수프, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_231" data-source="" data-orig="ready meals">ready meals</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_232" data-source="" data-orig="and other products requiring a smooth">and other products requiring a smooth</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_233" data-source="" data-orig="creamy texture">creamy texture</span>.</p></div><hr /><h2 data-start="6490" data-end="6520"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Refere